Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Re-extract changed promises, rerun examples and targeted behavior probes, and inspect linked pages for stale repetitions. Publish the reviewed bundle only when its examples and claims correspond to the same release version.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
